rld/uk/uk-man-pleads-guilty-in-us-hacking-case-involving-over-8m-in-virtual-currency-theft/articleshow/130353449.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T18:08:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130354039,imgsize-832577.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Britons opt for UK staycations as rising costs and travel concerns hit overseas trips]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130348885.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/britons-opt-for-uk-staycations-as-rising-costs-and-travel-concerns-hit-overseas-trips/articleshow/130348885.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/britons-opt-for-uk-staycations-as-rising-costs-and-travel-concerns-hit-overseas-trips/articleshow/130348885.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T13:03:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130349158,imgsize-1272419.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What is so special about Iran’s uranium that US, China and Russia all want it?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130346730.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran's enriched uranium stockpile has become a focal point in a global power contest, with the US, China, and Russia vying for influence. Tehran insists the material will not be handed over, despite US claims of an impending agreement for its recovery. This dispute highlights the complex political and strategic stakes surrounding Iran's nuclear program.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/what-is-so-special-about-irans-uranium-that-us-china-and-russia-all-want-it-all-you-need-to-know-about-nuclear-dust/articleshow/130346730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/what-is-so-special-about-irans-uranium-that-us-china-and-russia-all-want-it-all-you-need-to-know-about-nuclear-dust/articleshow/130346730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T11:32:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130348010,imgsize-2584389.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Netanyahu shocked by Trump's post on Lebanon? Report claims Israel asked US for clarification]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130346492.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[United States President Donald Trump has declared Israel is prohibited from conducting further airstrikes in Lebanon. This statement surprised Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu. Meanwhile, Iran announced it is reopening the Strait of Hormuz to commercial shipping. This move signals potential progress in broader United States-Iran diplomacy. Despite the ceasefire, some military activity was reported.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/netanyahu-shocked-by-trumps-post-on-lebanon-report-claims-israel-asked-us-for-clarification/articleshow/130346492.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/netanyahu-shocked-by-trumps-post-on-lebanon-report-claims-israel-asked-us-for-clarification/articleshow/130346492.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T09:11:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130346591,imgsize-59342.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Trust Trump, not panicans’: Donald pushes ‘the peace president’ image after 'reopening' Hormuz]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130347262.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Donald Trump declared himself "The Peace President," claiming to have settled eight wars while simultaneously issuing stern warnings of military action against Iran if ongoing negotiations fail. He highlighted potential progress in West Asia, including a reported ceasefire between Israel and Lebanon, though Iran disputed claims about the Strait of Hormuz.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trust-trump-not-panicans-donald-pushes-the-peace-president-image-after-reopening-hormuz/articleshow/130347262.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trust-trump-not-panicans-donald-pushes-the-peace-president-image-after-reopening-hormuz/articleshow/130347262.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T11:14:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130347775,imgsize-901832.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lebanese return to ‘unliveable’ areas as ceasefire with Israel mostly holds]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130346080.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/lebanese-return-to-unliveable-areas-as-ceasefire-with-israel-mostly-holds/articleshow/130346080.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/lebanese-return-to-unliveable-areas-as-ceasefire-with-israel-mostly-holds/articleshow/130346080.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T08:12:36+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130346117,imgsize-987289.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UK farmer plans to breed ‘less photogenic’ Highland cows to stop tourists and influencers filming them]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130347301.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-farmer-plans-to-breed-less-photogenic-highland-cows-to-stop-tourists-and-influencers-filming-them/articleshow/130347301.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-farmer-plans-to-breed-less-photogenic-highland-cows-to-stop-tourists-and-influencers-filming-them/articleshow/130347301.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-18T10:37:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130347393,imgsize-871880.cms"/></item></channel></rss>